{%- comment -%}
We use Shopify as our ecommerce platform.
Caution! Please read https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/promoting-marketing/seo/editing-robots-txt before proceeding to make changes to this file.

IMPORTANT - READ BEFORE ADDING ANY RULE:
robots.txt matching is PREFIX-based and UNANCHORED. "Disallow: /b" does not
mean the path /b - it means EVERY path beginning with /b, which includes the
entire /blogs/ tree. "Disallow: /products/r" blocks every product handle
starting with the letter r.

Never add a partial path. If you must block one exact URL, anchor it with $:
  Disallow: /products/some-exact-handle$

Do NOT add rules to block 404ing URLs. Blocking a 404 stops Google from ever
seeing the 404, so the URL stays in the index forever. Let 404s 404.
{%- endcomment -%}

